{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-q-connection","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Example","doco:Section"],"label":"ex:q-connection","kind":"example","title":"$q$-Deformed connection","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/ex-instanton","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-connection"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-connection","tags":["connection","archimedean"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.qConnection","text":"q-connection.md","leanSource":"q-connection.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"ex:q-connection\"></a><p>In the archimedean realisation, the categorical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-connection specialises to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A_q = q^{-1}A + (1 - q^{-1})\\iota_\\xi A\\varTheta</code>. At <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q = 1</code>, it recovers the full instanton connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code>. As <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q \\to \\infty</code>, it reduces to the Reeb component <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\iota_\\xi A\\varTheta</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-connection.md","heading":"Example","number":"4.20.3","page":"b/ex-q-connection","qa":{"counts":{"pass":65,"fail":0,"warn":1,"na":8,"unknown":0,"stale":48},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.qConnection","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-connection.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
